#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "56_Whiny Man"
msgid "Forget it! Those girls hate my guts!"
msgstr "¡Olvídalo! ¡¡Esas mujeres me detestan!!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "68_Calming Woman"
msgid "Don't give up now... After all, you've only seen three of\\r\nthem."
msgstr "No te rindas... Además, solo solicitaste tres chicas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "80_Whiny Man"
msgid "Yeah, and each one gave me the same open-mouthed stare. My\\r\nbest jokes flew right over their heads!"
msgstr "¡Y todas y cada una de ellas se quedaron heladas con mi mejor chiste!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "92_Whiny Man"
msgid "I'm tellin' you, it isn't workin' out! It's no use. I'll\\r\nnever manage an article on hostess club tips and tricks."
msgstr "¡Te dije que esto no iba a funcionar! No puedo, no puedo. ¡Escribir un artículo sobre cómo conquistar a las chicas de los clubes es imposible para mí!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "104_Akiyama"
msgid "Excuse me. I hate to interrupt, but if you're not going in,\\r\nwould you mind moving aside?"
msgstr "Perdón, perdón, tengo que pasar por acá, ¿les importaría moverse un poquito?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "128_Calming Woman"
msgid "Ah, sorry! We'll get out of your way."
msgstr "Ah, ¡disculpe! ¡Ya nos vamos!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "140_Akiyama"
msgid "Wait, aren't you Minamizawa-san? From the Mars Fighters\\r\ncomedy duo? Wow! I'm a big fan of yours!"
msgstr "...Un momento, ¿usted no es Minamizawa-san del dúo de comediantes Mars Fighters? ¡Hey! ¡Soy su fan!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "152_Calming Woman"
msgid "See, Minamizawa-san? I told you you had plenty of fans in\\r\nKanto."
msgstr "¿Lo ve, Minamizawa-san? ¡Le dije que también tenía muchos admiradores en la región de Kanto!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "164_Akiyama"
msgid "Are you here for work? Hope it goes well. I'll be rooting\\r\nfor you."
msgstr "¿Está aquí por trabajo? Espero que te vaya bien, ¡mucho ánimo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "176_Minamizawa"
msgid "Thanks a lot. I appreciate it!"
msgstr "¡Muchas gracias!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "188_Calming Woman"
msgid "(Minamizawa-san, this is your chance! This fan of yours seems to know the nightlife around here. Maybe he can tell us about the hostess clubs.)"
msgstr "(Minamizawa-san, ¡esta es tu oportunidad! Parece que este señorito es un aficionado a las salidas nocturnas, ¿por qué no le pides que te enseñe sobre los clubs de por aquí...?)"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "200_Minamizawa"
msgid "(What are you talkin' about? You want me to embarrass myself in front of a fan!?)"
msgstr "(¡Pero qué dices! ¡¿Acaso quieres dejarme en ridículo frente a un fan?!)"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "212_Calming Woman"
msgid "(Here's the thing, Minamizawa-san. Entertainers have to be responsible if they want to get hired back. Fulfilling your assignment is paramount.)"
msgstr "(A ver, Minamizawa-san. Los artistas deben hacer su trabajo con total confianza. Si no lo hacen como es debido, entonces no serán contratados nuevamente.)"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "224_Calming Woman"
msgid "(Keep up the spoiled-brat act, and I'll see to it you never darken the doorstep of our publishing house again.)"
msgstr "(...Si vas a seguir quejándote como un niñito, me aseguraré de que nunca te representemos otra vez)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "236_Minamizawa"
msgid "All right. Okay. I'll do it."
msgstr "Está bien, está bien. Lo haré."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "248_Calming Woman"
msgid "Excuse me! Do you happen to frequent hostess clubs, if I may\\r\nbe so bold as to ask?"
msgstr "¡Oye, disculpa la molestia! Pero quería saber si sueles frecuentar estos clubes."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "260_Akiyama"
msgid "Hm? Yeah, I guess you could say that."
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Yo? Digamos que sí..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "272_Ashibe"
msgid "Wonderful! Allow me to introduce myself. I am Ashibe, an\\r\neditor for \"Casanova,\" a magazine for men who want to\\r\nbecome more popular with the ladies. And, er..."
msgstr "¡Perfecto! Permíteme presentarme. Soy Ashibe, editora de “Catch Love”, una revista para hombres que quieren ser populares con las mujeres. Y, bueno..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "284_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, I'm Akiyama."
msgstr "Oh, yo soy Akiyama."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "296_Ashibe"
msgid "The thing is, Akiyama-san, we've commissioned a series of\\r\narticles from Minamizawa-san here on some tips to use at the\\r\nclubs Jewel and Shine."
msgstr "Verá, Akiyama-san, lo que pasa es que le pedimos a Minamizawa-san que escribiera algunos consejos para cuando uno va a \"Jewel\" o \"Shine\"."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "308_Ashibe"
msgid "But it seems they do things differently out west, where\\r\nMinamizawa-san is from. He's having a hard time hitting it off with these Tokyo girls."
msgstr "Pero parece que en Kansai las cosas son un poco diferentes, por lo que le está costando hacer amiguitas por acá."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "320_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, I'm sorry to hear that..."
msgstr "Oh, qué mal..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "332_Ashibe"
msgid "Do you think you could give Minamizawa-san a little info on\\r\nsome of the girls at the clubs I've mentioned?"
msgstr "¿Cree que podría darle consejos a Minamizawa-san sobre cómo platicar con las chicas de \"Jewel\" y \"Shine\"?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "344_Ashibe"
msgid "I'll pay you for your time, of course. Come on,\\r\nMinamizawa-san. Don't you have something to add?"
msgstr "¡Y por supuesto que le voy a compensar por ello!\\r\n¡Ven Minamizawa-san, pídeselo tú también!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "356_Minamizawa"
msgid "Please...?"
msgstr "P-por favor..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "368_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, I guess I could tell you about a couple of my\\r\nfavorites..."
msgstr "Mmmhh, bueno... Creo que podría hablarle de mis chicas favoritas..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "380_Ashibe"
msgid "That would be wonderful! Thank you very much!"
msgstr "¡Eso sería genial! ¡Muchas gracias!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "392_Ashibe"
msgid "We're working out of Cuez Bar in the Kamurocho Underground\\r\nMall. Could you stop by there when you have some info for\\r\nus?"
msgstr "Trabajamos en Cuez Bar en el centro comercial subterráneo de Kamurocho. ¿Sería tan amable de visitarnos cada vez que consiga información?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "404_Minamizawa"
msgid "Please, whenever you can!"
msgstr "¡P-Por favor y g-gracias!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "416_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure thing. I'll see you later, then."
msgstr "Lo tengo. Entonces, nos vemos luego."

